[{"client_msg_id":"71459768-7a27-4c20-87a3-123ce759fc61","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"pythonのバージョン変えられる現象は知らなかったですわ\nconda側としてもよかれと思ってやってるんでしょうけども","ts":"1617200746.092600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZGJh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"642a7c26-d9a7-4d7e-bd73-54ffe4beda58","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"もちろん確認がでますが。","ts":"1617200694.091800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vnpF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8ed580d-a705-4d5d-bf9c-3a6bf36384c9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"conda、python 自身もインストールされるんですが、依存がおかしいと python のバージョンすら変えられてしまい、気付いたら python のバージョンが下がってるみたいな事故も起きたりします。","ts":"1617200679.091500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bpn8W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"127a9f5a-7b68-4ea3-a832-efa365e94a72","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"マイクロバージョンまで指定したい時あるのか。知らない世界だ....","ts":"1617190884.089500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U771W8C56"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W44"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e72ecfe-2e31-4f2b-933b-a32bb28626f5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ただライセンスが変わってしまったので商用では pip 使わないといけなくなった。","ts":"1617190192.088200","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1617190207.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=eg03"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52f52aa6-71f2-4ed3-9108-75aa8f0a8647","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"conda は opencv なんかも依存で入るので Windows ユーザにはありがたいんですよね。","ts":"1617190160.088100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RBrw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9c6a51b-efe9-4e5f-9f74-7ddcc15860c5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そのさらに依存してる dll は Windows は辛い。","ts":"1617189766.088000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mmBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8ff60a7-7f58-4387-8739-733d85200c54","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"pyd は py から起動時にダイナミックロードされてシンボルチェック入るので Linux もフェアという意味で書きました。","ts":"1617189745.087900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rxJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a80c7fe-3248-4d9c-b678-3695ae8b6172","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"要はダイナミックリンクライブラリとしてそのシステム向けにビルドしてるわけですしね","ts":"1617189714.087800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q16"}]},{"client_msg_id":"709c2cc5-fdf3-4f20-adef-a9da1541e7fa","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"はい。","ts":"1617189625.087200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb9d383f-27ee-4314-aed7-511112727eb7","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"pydは拡張子がそうなってるだけで、中身はただのDLLですよね","ts":"1617189549.087100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zEM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c33a1a3-1f52-434d-a378-505d086006ae","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"pyd はチェック掛かるか。dll はもろにそう。","ts":"1617189396.086100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gZP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72b43c9b-0a03-42ed-865e-51ee00b68c9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんですよねー","ts":"1617189390.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rUe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c993aec0-4761-43a9-9cbd-f1fe67794190","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Linux だと pyd に使ってないシンボルがあってもなくても動くんですが、Windows って起動時にシンボルが一通り一致してないと動かないんですよね。","ts":"1617189346.085800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mfM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55c1fa45-f63f-4980-8ad1-3a147d7ec233","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"機械学習だとほぼ 3.7 指定でないとパッケージが動かなかったりもありますね。","ts":"1617189198.085700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5dpC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aabde1b1-adce-401e-bb0f-2ee193d821ac","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"厳密な python のバージョン指定？","ts":"1617189114.085600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iap"}]},{"client_msg_id":"363ca8fe-80fa-43f8-a16a-09206353a94f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"venv 切り替えるのと何が違うんだろう。エディター再起動しなくて済むくらい？","ts":"1617188463.085100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3e53346-cf5f-4a51-adec-fd60f0ee31b7","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"今でこそpyenv-winがあるからWindowsでも仮想環境作れますけどpyenvは元々Windowsでは使えないので\nお手軽に仮想環境作れるという点でもcondaは便利でした","ts":"1617188457.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AO5Ja"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cf72cae-37b4-4fae-87be-9e45da6211c9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あと VSCode って起動後に conda の env が切り替えられるので VSCode ユーザだと conda 便利なんですよ。","ts":"1617187990.083200","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1617187998.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HMsJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf618868-0c8f-44d0-8344-83b525c0b4b9","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"データサイエンス系の仕事があるのって非IT系の会社であることも多いので\nPython使う為にわざわざUnix環境用意するってことが自分の観測範囲ではあまり無いですね\nだから色々ツッコみどころがあるとしてもAnacondaは欠かせないです","ts":"1617186798.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U03C6TEAZ"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oAOa"}]}]
